// Generated from the 97 supplied Yokohama technical data sheets.
// Values contain the TDS PRODUCT DESCRIPTION section only.
export const YOKOHAMA_TDS_ENGLISH_DESCRIPTIONS: Record<string, string> = {
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:boron-oil-m":
    "YOKOHAMA BORON OIL M is a multi-purpose, water-miscible metalworking concentrate developed for cutting and grinding operations. When mixed with water, it forms an emulsion intended to combine effective cooling with lubrication at the tool-workpiece interface. The fluid helps manage friction and heat generation while assisting chip removal and surface cleanliness. Stable emulsion management, corrosion control and appropriate filtration support consistent machining conditions and dependable fluid-system operation.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:compressor-oil-32-46-68":
    "YOKOHAMA COMPRESSOR OIL is a range of industrial compressor lubricants in ISO VG 32, 46 and 68, developed to support lubrication and heat transfer in compressed-air equipment. The lubricants are intended to help maintain a protective oil film on moving components while controlling wear, corrosion, oxidation and deposit formation. Air-release, water-separation and foam-control characteristics are relevant to the reliable operation of compressor lubrication circuits and oil-air separation equipment.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:cutting-oil-22-32-46-68":
    "YOKOHAMA CUTTING OIL is a range of neat cutting oils supplied in ISO VG 22, 32, 46 and 68, intended for metal-removal processes without water dilution. The oil is designed to establish a lubricating film in the cutting zone, helping control friction and machining heat. Consistent supply supports chip evacuation, dimensional consistency and the quality of machined surfaces. Lower-viscosity grades favour fluid delivery, while higher grades provide a more substantial lubricating film where suitable.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-atf-dii":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON ATF DII is an automatic transmission fluid formulated for systems requiring DEXRON II-D-type performance. Its friction characteristics are intended to support controlled clutch engagement and consistent torque-converter operation. The fluid provides lubrication and helps manage wear, oxidation, corrosion and foaming in transmission components and hydraulic circuits.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-atf-diii":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON ATF DIII is a semi-synthetic automatic transmission fluid formulated for DEXRON III and MERCON-type automatic transmissions. Its balanced friction response promotes controlled clutch operation and smooth gear shifting. The formulation is designed to help preserve oil-film continuity over changing temperatures and to control oxidation, wear, foam and corrosion in transmission assemblies.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-atf-iii-h":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON ATF III-H is a semi-synthetic ATF intended for transmissions using DEXRON III-family or MERCON-type fluids. Balanced frictional properties assist controlled clutch engagement and smooth shifting. Its lubrication characteristics help protect gears and bearings as temperatures change, while oxidation, deposit, corrosion and foam control support consistent operation of the hydraulic system.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-atf-mb":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON ATF MB is a fully synthetic automatic transmission fluid described for Mercedes-Benz MB 236.14-type requirements. Its controlled friction performance is designed to assist clutch and torque-converter lock-up operation and smooth ratio changes. The synthetic base-oil and additive formulation is intended to provide oxidation resistance, shear stability and wear protection for bearings and gears, while cold-flow, corrosion and foam control support hydraulic response.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-atf-vi":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON ATF VI is a low-viscosity, fully synthetic transmission fluid for stepped automatic gearboxes requiring DEXRON VI performance. Balanced friction characteristics help promote controlled clutch-pack and torque-converter lock-up engagement. Shear and oxidation stability support lubrication at operating temperature, while the fluid helps protect gear, bearing and hydraulic-control components against wear, deposits, corrosion and foaming.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-cvt-atf":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON CVT ATF is a fully synthetic transmission fluid described for compatible belt- or chain-driven continuously variable transmissions and selected stepped automatics using corresponding fluid categories. Carefully balanced friction characteristics help support consistent power transfer and driveability. Lubrication and wear control contribute to moving-component protection, while oxidation, corrosion and foam control assist operating stability.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-cvt-fluid":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON CVT FLUID is a fully synthetic transmission fluid intended for belt- and chain-driven continuously variable transmissions. Its frictional properties are designed to help maintain effective contact between the pulleys and the metal belt or chain, supporting stable power transfer and smooth operation. Wear protection and resistance to oxidation and corrosion help preserve transmission components and fluid performance.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-dsg-fluid":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON DSG FLUID is a fully synthetic fluid developed for wet dual-clutch transmission (DCT/DSG) applications in which clutch packs, gears and hydraulic control circuits operate together. Balanced friction characteristics help support controlled clutch engagement and smooth gear changes. Viscosity and oxidation stability promote a dependable lubricating film, while wear, corrosion and foam control contribute to component protection.",
  "Otomatik-Transmisyon-Yaglari:dexron-mv-atf":
    "YOKOHAMA DEXRON MV ATF is a fully synthetic automatic transmission fluid designed for a range of stepped automatic gearboxes across different vehicle manufacturers. Its controlled friction characteristics help maintain consistent clutch operation and smooth shift quality. The fluid combines lubrication for gears and bearings with wear, oxidation, corrosion and foam control to support dependable transmission performance.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:gearbox-68-100-150-220-320":
    "YOKOHAMA GEARBOX is a series of industrial gear lubricants based on conventional mineral oil technology and an extreme-pressure (EP) additive system. Designed for enclosed gear drives operating under substantial mechanical loads, the range supports load carrying capacity and protective oil-film formation on gear teeth and bearings. Its lubricant characteristics aim to manage wear, oxidation, rust and corrosion, while water separation and foam control help maintain dependable splash and circulating lubrication.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:heat-transfer-oil-32-46":
    "YOKOHAMA HEAT TRANSFER OIL is a range of mineral-based heat transfer fluids developed for indirect process heating in industrial circulation systems. The oils are intended to transfer heat between a heater and process equipment while supporting stable temperature control. Thermal and oxidation stability help limit oil degradation, viscosity changes and deposit formation; suitable fluidity assists circulation and maintains heat-exchanger performance.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:hydro-iso-22-32-37-46-68-100":
    "YOKOHAMA HYDRO is a series of conventional mineral-based, anti-wear hydraulic oils intended for industrial and suitable mobile fluid-power systems. Designed to maintain lubrication in hydraulic pumps, valves and actuators, the range helps manage component wear, oxidation, corrosion and deposit formation. Water separation, filtration, air release and foam control support consistent pressure transmission and hydraulic circuit cleanliness over normal operating conditions.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:hydro-s-22-32-37-46-68":
    "YOKOHAMA HYDRO S is a high-viscosity-index hydraulic oil range designed to support lubrication and wear control across a wide range of operating temperatures. Its viscosity-temperature characteristics help maintain fluidity during cold starts and a protective lubricating film under normal operating conditions. Oxidation stability, rust and corrosion control, water separation, filterability, air release and foam resistance support reliable operation of hydraulic pumps and control elements.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-12-ms-bxfe":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-12 MS-BXFE is a fully synthetic, ultra-low-viscosity engine oil developed around the SAE 0W-12 grade and BMW Longlife-22 FE++ performance requirements for selected gasoline engines. Its viscosity characteristics are intended to promote efficient oil circulation during cold starts and reduced fluid-friction losses during operation. The lubricant formulation is designed to support wear control, oxidation resistance and engine cleanliness.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-16-g6-xfe":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-16 G6-XFE is a fully synthetic engine oil designed for modern gasoline and selected hybrid engines requiring SAE 0W-16 viscosity. Its low-viscosity characteristics help reduce internal fluid friction and support rapid oil circulation during cold starts. The additive system is intended to assist wear protection, oxidation stability, piston cleanliness and deposit control. API SP and ILSAC GF-6B categories address tests relevant to low-speed pre-ignition (LSPI) and timing-chain wear.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-16-rxfe":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-16 RXFE is a fully synthetic, fuel-efficiency-oriented engine oil developed for new-generation gasoline and hybrid powertrains requiring the SAE 0W-16 grade. Its low viscosity supports oil delivery during frequent stop-start cycles while the lubricant formulation is intended to reduce friction, manage wear and oxidation and help maintain piston-area cleanliness.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-20-c5-p":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-20 C5 P is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS engine oil developed for gasoline and light-duty diesel engines with fuel-efficiency-oriented SAE 0W-20 and ACEA C5 requirements. The low-viscosity lubrication profile is intended to support cold-start oil circulation and reduced friction. Additive technology helps manage wear, oxidation and deposits while taking account of compatible diesel and gasoline particulate filters and catalytic aftertreatment systems.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w20-ls-fe":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-20 LS-FE is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS engine oil designed for modern gasoline, suitable light-duty diesel and selected hybrid engines requiring an SAE 0W-20 low-HTHS fuel-economy lubricant. Its viscosity profile supports efficient cold-start oil circulation and friction reduction, while the additive formulation helps manage wear, oxidation and engine deposits. Emissions-system considerations include compatible DPF/GPF and catalytic aftertreatment applications.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-20-sp-rc":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-20 SP/RC is a fully synthetic low-viscosity engine oil formulated for modern gasoline and suitable hybrid engines. Its low-friction lubrication profile is intended to support fuel efficiency, rapid oil circulation on cold start and protection of moving components. Additive technology addresses wear, oxidation and deposit control in the context of API SP Resource Conserving and ILSAC GF-6A performance requirements, including relevant LSPI and timing-chain tests.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-30-dpf":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-30 DPF is a fully synthetic, low-SAPS engine oil developed for suitable gasoline and light-duty diesel engines calling for SAE 0W-30 and ACEA C3 performance. The formulation is designed to maintain a protective oil film at elevated operating temperatures while supporting cold-start oil circulation. Its reduced-ash additive approach considers diesel and gasoline particulate filters and catalytic aftertreatment, with wear, oxidation and deposit control intended to support engine cleanliness.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-30-ll":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-30 LL is a fully synthetic, low-SAPS engine oil developed for modern gasoline and light-duty diesel engines requiring SAE 0W-30 viscosity and ACEA C3 performance. Its formulation is designed to promote rapid oil circulation during cold starts, maintain a stable lubricating film at operating temperatures, and support wear control. A controlled‐ash additive system is designed for DPF/GPF and catalytic aftertreatment applications. Oxidation stability and detergent‐dispersant properties help control deposits and maintain engine cleanliness.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-30-sp":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-30 SP is a fully synthetic engine oil developed for modern gasoline and selected light-duty diesel engines requiring SAE 0W-30 viscosity. Its low-viscosity characteristics help support efficient engine operation, rapid oil circulation during cold starts and a stable lubricating film throughout normal operating conditions. The balanced base oil and additive system is designed to assist wear protection, oxidation resistance and control of sludge and deposits. Developed with the ACEA A5/B5 and C2 performance profiles in mind, the formulation targets fuel efficiency and, where specified, compatibility with applicable exhaust aftertreatment systems. Suitability depends on the engine manufacturer's oil requirements.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-40-c3-sp":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 0W-40 C3 SP is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS lubricant for modern gasoline and light-duty diesel engines requiring SAE 0W-40 and ACEA C3. Its low-temperature flow supports rapid oil circulation at start-up, while its viscosity characteristics help maintain a protective oil film under high-temperature conditions. A balanced additive system helps control wear, oxidation and deposits while supporting compatible after-treatment equipment, including DPF/GPF units and catalytic converters, when permitted by the engine manufacturer.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 0W-40 is a fully synthetic engine oil developed for demanding gasoline and suitable light-duty diesel engines requiring ACEA A3/B4 performance. Its viscosity characteristics help maintain a durable lubricating film at elevated operating temperatures, while the SAE 0W winter grade supports rapid oil circulation during cold starts. A carefully selected base oil and additive system is formulated to support wear protection, oxidation resistance and the control of sludge and deposits, helping maintain engine cleanliness across a wide range of operating conditions.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-0w-8-glv-1":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE 0W-8 GLV-1 is a fully synthetic, ultra-low-viscosity engine oil developed for new-generation gasoline and hybrid powertrains designed for the SAE 0W-8 grade. Its low-friction lubrication characteristics are intended to support improved fuel efficiency and rapid oil circulation at start-up. The formulation approach combines wear and oxidation control with management of deposits under frequent stop-start operation.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-10w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 10W-50 is a fully synthetic racing engine oil formulated with PAO and ester base oils for high-performance engines operating under high loads and at high speeds. Its balanced additive system is designed to help reduce friction losses and protect engine components against wear. The SAE 10W-50 viscosity profile supports a durable lubricating film at operating temperature and lubrication continuity in demanding service.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-10w-60":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 10W-60 is a high-performance engine oil developed for engines operating at elevated oil temperatures and under heavy mechanical loads. Its SAE 10W-60 viscosity profile is intended to support oil-film strength at operating temperature during sporting driving and competition. A quality base-oil formulation and balanced additive system are designed to provide protection for turbocharged gasoline engines and suitable diesel engines in demanding service, including hot-climate and high-load applications.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-20w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 20W-50 is a multigrade engine oil formulated for four-stroke gasoline engines and suitable diesel engines. Its balanced additive system combines oxidation resistance and cleaning performance to help control deposit formation and maintain engine operating condition throughout service. The SAE 20W-50 viscosity profile is designed to support a durable lubricating film at operating temperature. Its mineral base-oil formulation is intended for engines that specify this viscosity grade.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-20-d1-3":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-20 DI-3 is a fully synthetic engine oil developed for gasoline direct-injection and turbocharged engines where SAE 5W-20 is specified. Its low-viscosity formulation is designed to support fuel-efficient operation while maintaining a protective lubricating film and promoting reliable oil circulation during cold starts. A balanced base oil and additive system helps control wear, oxidation and deposits to support engine cleanliness. API SN Plus performance requirements place particular emphasis on protection against low-speed pre-ignition (LSPI), which can affect certain turbocharged gasoline direct-injection engines.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-20-sp-rc":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-20 SP/RC is a fully synthetic engine oil developed for modern gasoline engines, including turbocharged direct-injection designs and compatible hybrid powertrains, where SAE 5W-20 is specified. Its low-viscosity characteristics are intended to help reduce frictional losses and support efficient lubrication during cold starts and everyday driving. The balanced base oil and additive system is formulated to support wear protection, oxidation stability and engine cleanliness by helping limit deposit and sludge formation. The API SP Resource Conserving and ILSAC GF-6A performance categories address demanding requirements including low-speed pre-ignition (LSPI) and timing-chain wear in applicable gasoline engines.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-30-2":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-30 API SN/CF is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS engine oil developed for suitable gasoline and light-duty diesel engines requiring SAE 5W-30 and ACEA C3 performance. It is designed to support stable oil-film protection, wear control and dependable lubrication across a broad range of operating temperatures. Its balanced detergent-dispersant and oxidation-control technology helps limit sludge and deposit formation. The controlled ash, phosphorus and sulphur profile is intended to support compatible diesel particulate filters (DPF), gasoline particulate filters (GPF) and catalytic exhaust aftertreatment systems.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-30-c2-c3":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-30 C2/C3 is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS engine oil developed for suitable gasoline, light-duty diesel and hybrid powertrains. It is designed to provide reliable lubrication, wear protection and stable oil-film performance over a wide range of operating conditions. Its balanced additive technology supports oxidation control and helps reduce sludge and deposits to maintain engine cleanliness. The controlled ash, phosphorus and sulphur profile is intended to support compatible diesel and gasoline particulate filters (DPF/GPF) and catalytic exhaust aftertreatment systems.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-30-sp-rc":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-30 SP/RC is a fully synthetic engine oil developed for modern gasoline and compatible hybrid powertrains requiring a fuel-economy-focused lubricant. Its low-friction characteristics are intended to support efficient engine operation while maintaining a protective lubricating film over a wide range of operating temperatures. Selected base oil and additive technology is designed to help control wear, oxidation, sludge and piston deposits. The API SP Resource Conserving and ILSAC GF-6A performance framework includes requirements addressing low-speed pre-ignition (LSPI) and timing-chain wear in turbocharged gasoline direct-injection engines.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-30":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-30 is a fully synthetic, mid-SAPS engine oil developed for modern gasoline and light-duty diesel engines that require ACEA C3 performance. Its balanced formulation is intended to maintain lubricating-film integrity under varying operating temperatures and support wear protection in demanding service. Selected base oil and additive technology helps manage oxidation, sludge and deposit formation while supporting engine cleanliness. The controlled sulphated ash, phosphorus and sulphur profile is designed for compatibility with suitable diesel particulate filters (DPF), gasoline particulate filters (GPF) and catalytic aftertreatment systems.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-5w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SAE 5W-50 is a multi-grade engine oil developed for compatible gasoline and earlier-generation light-duty diesel engines. Its wide viscosity range is intended to support lubricating-film continuity, wear control and engine cleanliness across varying operating temperatures and demanding service conditions.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:improve-10w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA IMPROVE SMOKE STOP SAE 10W-40 is a multigrade engine oil for compatible four-stroke gasoline, LPG and light-duty diesel engines. Its detergent-dispersant system supports engine cleanliness and deposit control, while its viscosity profile is designed to maintain lubricating-film continuity across operating temperatures. The SMOKE STOP formulation is intended to help reduce visible exhaust smoke associated with oil consumption.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:mono-grade-sae-10":
    "YOKOHAMA MONO GRADE SAE 10 is a single-grade engine oil for equipment designed to operate on this viscosity. Its detergent and dispersant characteristics help manage combustion by-products and deposit formation, while oxidation control helps limit oil thickening during service. Lubricating protection supports dependable operation in engines and other equipment whose requirements call for this grade.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:mono-grade-sae-30":
    "YOKOHAMA MONO GRADE SAE 30 is a single-grade engine oil for engines and equipment that specify this viscosity. Its detergent and dispersant properties help control combustion-related deposits and sludge, while oxidation resistance helps limit oil thickening in service. The formulation supports wear and corrosion protection for dependable operation in traditional engines using monograde oil.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:mono-grade-sae-40":
    "YOKOHAMA MONO GRADE SAE 40 is a single-grade engine oil for four-stroke engines requiring this viscosity. Its detergent and dispersant properties help control deposits and sludge, while its lubricating film supports protection against wear and corrosion under specified service conditions.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:motiso-hp-2-t-amber":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTISO HP 2-T AMBER is a two-stroke petrol engine oil for motorcycles and small-engine equipment requiring API TC and JASO FC performance. Its lubricating and deposit-control properties support component protection and engine cleanliness, while clean-burning behaviour helps limit exhaust smoke and spark-plug deposits.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:motiso-hp-2-t-green":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTISO HP 2-T GREEN is a semi-synthetic two-stroke petrol engine oil developed to support piston, ring and cylinder protection while helping control deposits. Its clean-burning characteristics help limit spark-plug fouling and exhaust deposits, supporting reliable operation across changing engine speeds and loads.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:motiso-hp-2-t-red":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTISO HP 2-T RED is a semi-synthetic two-stroke petrol engine oil formulated to support lubrication and cleanliness in motorcycle engines. Its lubricating film helps protect piston, ring and cylinder surfaces, while deposit-control properties help maintain clean combustion and reduce exhaust smoke, spark-plug fouling and ring sticking.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:moto-power-4t-10w-30":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTO POWER 4T 10W-30 is a semi-synthetic four-stroke motorcycle oil developed for engines that share lubrication with the transmission and wet clutch. Its balanced formulation supports engine cleanliness, wear control and stable clutch engagement during everyday riding.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:moto-power-4t-10w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTO POWER 4T 10W-40 is a semi-synthetic four-stroke motorcycle engine oil designed for shared-sump systems. It supports lubrication of the engine, gearbox and wet clutch, with wear and oxidation control and friction characteristics intended to maintain consistent clutch operation and gear shifts.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:moto-power-4t-10w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTO POWER 4T 10W-50 is a four-stroke motorcycle engine oil formulated to support wear protection and clean operation across engine, gearbox and wet-clutch components. Its viscosity and friction characteristics support lubrication under sustained operating temperatures and consistent clutch engagement in shared-sump systems.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:moto-power-4t-15w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTO POWER 4T 15W-40 is designed for four-stroke motorcycle engines that use a shared oil circuit for the engine, gearbox and wet clutch. Its lubricating and friction characteristics support wear protection, engine cleanliness and reliable clutch engagement across everyday riding conditions.",
  "Motosiklet-Yaglari:moto-power-4t-15w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA MOTO POWER 4T 15W-50 is formulated for four-stroke motorcycle engines, including high-performance designs operating under demanding conditions. Its lubricating characteristics help control wear and deposits, while its friction properties support smooth clutch engagement and gear changes in shared-sump systems.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:protec-10w-30":
    "YOKOHAMA PROTEC 10W-30 is a multigrade engine oil formulated for four-stroke diesel engines operating under variable loads. Its detergent and dispersant system helps manage soot, support piston cleanliness and protect against wear, while balanced viscosity performance supports operation across changing start-up and running temperatures.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:protec-10w-40-sm":
    "YOKOHAMA PROTEC 10W-40 SM is a semi-synthetic multigrade engine oil for gasoline, LPG and suitable diesel engines. Its API SM/CF and ACEA A3/B4 performance profile is designed to support a stable lubricating film at elevated operating temperatures and help maintain engine cleanliness. Detergent and dispersant additives help control deposits, while protective components support resistance to wear and oxidation.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:protec-10w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA PROTEC 10W-40 is a semi-synthetic multigrade engine oil for gasoline and LPG passenger car engines in everyday service. Its blend of synthetic and mineral base oils is designed to support lubrication from start-up through normal operating temperatures. Detergent and dispersant additives help control deposits and maintain engine cleanliness, while the oil film supports wear protection in both stop-and-go traffic and longer journeys.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:protec-15w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA PROTEC 15W-50 is a semi-synthetic multigrade engine oil for gasoline and suitable diesel engines. Its formulation is designed to help protect against wear and control the formation of sludge and deposits during service. The SAE 15W-50 grade provides a high-viscosity oil film at operating temperature for engines that specify this grade and the stated performance requirements.",
  "Binek-Arac-Motor-Yaglari:protec-20w-50":
    "YOKOHAMA PROTEC 20W-50 is a multigrade engine oil formulated for gasoline and suitable diesel engines requiring this viscosity grade. Its detergent and dispersant system helps control sludge and deposits while supporting wear protection and oxidation resistance in everyday operation.",
  "Endustriyel-Yaglar:slide-oil-32-68-220":
    "YOKOHAMA SLIDE OIL is a range of ISO VG 32, 68 and 220 lubricants developed for machine tool slideways. Its adhesive oil film and controlled friction help limit stick-slip and support smooth, accurate table movement. Anti-wear, load-carrying and corrosion protection properties help protect guide surfaces under demanding conditions. Separation from water-miscible metalworking fluids supports cleaner coolant systems and consistent machine operation.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-20w-50-cf-4-sg":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 20W-50 CF-4/SG is a multigrade engine oil for commercial diesel engines and mixed fleets. Detergent-dispersant properties help suspend combustion by-products and limit deposit build-up, while oxidation control and anti-wear protection support engine cleanliness and reliable lubrication under sustained operating loads.",
  "Traktor-ve-Tarim-Yaglari:t-ruck-20w-40-utto":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 20W-40 UTTO is a multipurpose tractor transmission and hydraulic oil for agricultural and off-highway equipment. Its friction characteristics support smooth operation of wet brakes and power take-off (PTO) systems, while anti-wear, oxidation and foam-control properties help protect gears and hydraulic components and support system cleanliness.",
  "Traktor-ve-Tarim-Yaglari:t-ruck-422-utto":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 422 is a multipurpose tractor transmission oil for combined transmission and hydraulic duties in agricultural and off-highway equipment. Its balanced friction characteristics support wet-brake and clutch operation, while anti-wear, oxidation and foam-control properties help protect gears, hydraulic components and shared-sump systems. Deposit and corrosion control supports system cleanliness and reliable power transfer across changing load conditions.",
  "Traktor-ve-Tarim-Yaglari:t-ruck-426-utto":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 426 is a multipurpose tractor transmission oil developed for equipment that uses a common lubricant for transmission and hydraulic functions. Its controlled friction behaviour supports smooth wet-brake and clutch engagement, while wear, oxidation and foam control help protect gears and hydraulic components under varied loads. Corrosion and deposit control contribute to clean, dependable operation in agricultural and off-highway machinery.",
  "Traktor-ve-Tarim-Yaglari:t-ruck-428-utto":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 428 is a multipurpose tractor transmission oil for agricultural and off-highway equipment with combined transmission, hydraulic and wet-brake systems. Its balanced friction response supports smooth brake and clutch operation, while anti-wear and oxidation-control properties help protect gears and hydraulic components. Corrosion and foam control contribute to reliable performance in shared-sump systems across changing operating conditions.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-140-gl-1":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 140 GL-1 is a single-grade gear lubricant for conventional manual transmissions and gear sets operating under low to moderate loads. Its lubricating film helps protect gear teeth and bearing surfaces under the specified service conditions. Formulated for applications that do not require extreme-pressure performance, it supports rust and corrosion control and resistance to oxidation and foaming.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-75w-gl-4":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 75W GL-4 is a full synthetic manual transmission lubricant developed for low-viscosity applications. Its synthetic base oils and anti-wear additives help maintain a protective film on gears and bearings. Low-temperature fluidity and balanced friction support synchronizer operation and smooth gear changes. Thermal and oxidation stability, together with foam and corrosion control, help protect transmission components across changing operating conditions.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-75w-80-gl-5":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 75W-80 GL-5 is a multi-grade gear lubricant developed for automotive gear systems operating under high loads. Extreme-pressure additives support the lubricating film at hypoid gear contacts and help control surface wear under demanding conditions. Low-temperature fluidity supports oil circulation to gears and bearings during start-up. Thermal and oxidation stability help resist thickening and deposit formation at operating temperature, while foam, rust and corrosion control support consistent lubrication as speed and load vary.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-75w-90-gl-4":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 75W-90 GL-4 is a fully synthetic manual transmission gear oil developed for reliable lubrication across changing loads and operating temperatures. Its low-temperature flow supports oil circulation during cold starts, while the lubricating film helps protect gear surfaces under high-speed and high-torque conditions. Wear, friction and corrosion control support dependable gear and synchronizer operation. Thermal and oxidation stability help maintain lubricant performance, and foam control supports consistent lubrication.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-75w-90-gl-5":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 75W-90 GL-5 is a semi-synthetic automotive gear oil developed for drivetrain components exposed to changing loads and temperatures. Its extreme-pressure and anti-wear characteristics help protect hypoid gear surfaces under high contact pressure, shock loading and low-speed, high-torque conditions. SAE 75W-90 fluidity supports oil circulation in cold operation and a continuous lubricating film at operating temperature. Oxidation resistance, together with rust, corrosion and foam control, supports reliable lubrication of gears and bearings.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-80w-gl-4":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 80W GL-4 is a monograde automotive gear oil developed for manual transmissions and mechanical gear systems. Its additive balance supports the lubricating film on load-bearing gear surfaces and helps control wear under medium extreme-pressure conditions, including high-speed, low-torque and low-speed, high-torque operation. Thermal and oxidation stability help limit oil thickening and deposit formation, while rust, corrosion and foam control support dependable lubrication of gears, bearings and related components.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-80w-90-gl-4":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 80W-90 GL-4 is a multigrade gear lubricant developed for manual transmissions and compatible automotive gear systems. Its lubricating film supports load-bearing gear contacts, while GL-4-level extreme-pressure performance helps protect components across changing speed and torque conditions. Thermal and oxidation stability help limit oil thickening and deposit formation during service. Rust, corrosion and foam control support reliable lubrication of gears, bearings and related drivetrain parts.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-80w-90-gl-5":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 80W-90 GL-5 is a multigrade automotive gear lubricant for drivetrain components operating under high loads and changing service conditions. Its extreme-pressure and anti-wear properties help protect hypoid gear surfaces subject to high contact pressure and shock loading. Thermal and oxidation stability help resist oil thickening and deposit formation, while rust, corrosion and foam control support dependable lubrication of gears and bearings.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-85w-140-gl-5":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION 85W-140 GL-5 is a multigrade gear lubricant for heavy-duty drivetrain components exposed to high loads and elevated operating temperatures. Its extreme-pressure and anti-wear properties help protect hypoid gear surfaces under high contact pressure and shock loading. The SAE 140 operating-temperature grade supports a load-bearing lubricating film, while thermal and oxidation stability help limit oil thickening and deposit formation. Rust, corrosion and foam control support dependable lubrication of gears and bearings.",
  "Disli-ve-Transmisyon-Yaglari:transmission-90-gl-1":
    "YOKOHAMA TRANSMISSION SAE 90 GL-1 is a single-grade gear lubricant for manual transmissions and gear drives operating under mild service conditions where API GL-1 protection is specified. Its SAE 90 viscosity supports a lubricating film across gear and bearing contacts. Thermal stability, oxidation resistance, rust protection and foam control help maintain dependable lubrication during service.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-0w-20-extra":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 0W-20 EXTRA is a low-viscosity heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for applications specifying SAE 0W-20 and IVECO 18-1804 Classe TLV LS. Its formulation supports engine lubrication while helping protect exhaust after-treatment systems and maintain fuel-efficient operation in compatible heavy-duty engines.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-0w-20":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 0W-20 is a low-viscosity heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for applications specifying SAE 0W-20 and Daimler Truck DTFR 15C140. Its formulation supports engine protection and helps protect exhaust after-treatment systems while supporting fuel-efficient operation in compatible engines.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-30-cf-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-30 CF-4 is a multigrade heavy-duty engine oil formulated for diesel engines in commercial and equipment applications. Its detergent-dispersant and anti-wear performance is designed to support engine cleanliness, soot control and protection under changing loads and operating temperatures.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-30-ci-4-sl":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-30 CI-4/SL is a multigrade engine oil for commercial diesel engines and off-highway equipment. Its detergent-dispersant and anti-wear formulation is designed to support engine cleanliness, soot control and wear protection under demanding operating conditions. The product profile includes API CI-4/SL, ACEA E7 and JASO DH-1 performance levels.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-30-ck-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-30 CK-4 is a heavy-duty multigrade engine oil developed for modern diesel engines operating under variable loads and temperatures. Its detergent-dispersant and anti-wear system is designed to help control soot, support engine cleanliness and maintain protection in demanding on-road and off-highway service. The formulation is intended for engines equipped with exhaust after-treatment systems, including DPF, SCR and EGR.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-30-h":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-30 H is a heavy-duty multigrade engine oil for on-road transport and off-highway operations. Its stated performance profile combines API CI-4/SL, ACEA A3/B4 and E7 (2012 catalogue) and Global DHD-1. The formulation is designed to support soot control, engine cleanliness and wear protection in demanding diesel service.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-30":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-30 is a semi-synthetic heavy-duty engine oil developed for demanding commercial diesel applications. Its detergent-dispersant and anti-wear formulation is designed to help control soot-related thickening, maintain engine cleanliness and protect critical components under varied operating loads.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-40-cf-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-40 CF-4 is a semi-synthetic multigrade heavy-duty engine oil developed for demanding commercial diesel applications. Its balanced additive system is designed to support soot control, oxidation resistance, piston cleanliness and wear protection under varied loads and operating temperatures.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-40-ch-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-40 CH-4 is a heavy-duty multigrade engine oil for demanding on-road and off-highway service. Its additive system is designed to limit soot-related thickening, control oxidation and deposits, and help protect critical engine components under high loads and temperatures.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-40-ci-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-40 CI-4 is a heavy-duty multigrade engine oil for commercial vehicles and off-highway equipment. Its detergent-dispersant and anti-wear system is designed to help control soot-related thickening and deposits, maintain engine cleanliness, and protect critical components under demanding loads and temperatures.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-10w-40-ck-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 10W-40 CK-4 is a heavy-duty multigrade engine oil developed for high-speed, four-stroke diesel engines operating under sustained load. Its low-SAPS performance profile is designed to help control soot-related thickening, deposits and wear while supporting engine cleanliness and compatibility with exhaust after-treatment systems.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-15w-40-cf-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 15W-40 CF-4 is a multigrade heavy-duty engine oil for four-stroke diesel engines in demanding on-road and off-highway service. Its detergent-dispersant system helps manage soot, sludge and piston deposits, while oxidation stability and wear control support engine cleanliness and protection under varied loads.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-15w-40-ci-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 15W-40 CI-4 is a multigrade diesel engine oil for mixed fleets and demanding heavy-duty service. Its detergent-dispersant system helps manage soot and deposits, while oxidation stability and wear control support engine cleanliness, viscosity control and component protection under sustained operating loads.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-15w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 15W-40 is a multigrade heavy-duty diesel engine oil for mixed fleets and demanding on-road and off-highway service. Its detergent-dispersant system helps manage soot and piston deposits, while oxidation stability and wear control support engine cleanliness, viscosity control and component protection under sustained loads.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-20w-50-ci-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 20W-50 CI-4 is a heavy-duty multigrade diesel engine oil for high-speed four-stroke engines in severe on- and off-highway service. Its detergent-dispersant balance helps control soot, oxidation and high-temperature deposits, while viscosity stability and wear protection support engine cleanliness and component durability under sustained loads.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-20":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-20 is a fully synthetic, low-viscosity heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for modern engines requiring SAE 5W-20 and the MAN M3977 or Scania LDF-5 performance profile. Its formulation supports engine protection and exhaust after-treatment compatibility in suitable applications, while its low-viscosity design supports fuel-efficient operation.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-30-ch-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-30 CH-4 is a fully synthetic heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for high-speed four-stroke engines. Its SAE 5W-30 formulation supports engine cleanliness, wear control and lubricant stability under demanding loads and extended operating conditions. The stated ACEA E4/E7 and API CI-4/CH-4 performance levels define its intended application profile.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-30-ck-4":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-30 CK-4 is a heavy-duty diesel engine oil for demanding on-road and off-road operation. Its SAE 5W-30 viscosity and stated performance profile support engine cleanliness, wear protection and resistance to oil breakdown in compatible applications.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-30-ls":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-30 LS is a low-SAPS heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for modern engines with exhaust after-treatment systems. Its SAE 5W-30 formulation and detergent-dispersant performance support engine cleanliness, wear protection and resistance to oil breakdown under demanding operating conditions.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-30-sn-plus":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-30 SN PLUS is a low-HTHS, low-SAPS heavy-duty diesel engine oil for applications specifying API FA-4 and ACEA F01. Its SAE 5W-30 formulation is designed to support fuel-efficient operation, engine cleanliness and compatibility with exhaust after-treatment systems.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-30-uhpd":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-30 UHPD is a full synthetic heavy-duty diesel engine oil formulated for stable lubrication in demanding commercial vehicle service. Its formulation is designed to support engine cleanliness, soot control and oxidation resistance while maintaining performance across a broad operating temperature range.",
  "Agir-Hizmet-Motor-Yaglari:t-ruck-5w-40":
    "YOKOHAMA T-RUCK 5W-40 is a full synthetic heavy-duty diesel engine oil developed for demanding operating conditions. Its low-SAPS formulation is designed to support soot and deposit control, oxidation stability and reliable lubrication across changing loads and temperatures, including applications with exhaust after-treatment systems.",
  "Deniz-Yaglari:yokomarin-wh-series":
    "YOKOHAMA YOKOMARIN WH Series comprises SAE 40 crankcase oils for medium-speed, four-stroke trunk-piston marine diesel engines. BN 30, BN 40 and BN 55 options provide different alkaline reserve levels for engines operating on residual fuels. Detergency and oxidation-control properties support piston-area cleanliness, neutralization of combustion acids and protection of loaded engine surfaces.",
  "Deniz-Yaglari:yokomarin-wl-series":
    "YOKOHAMA YOKOMARIN WL Series is a range of SAE 50 cylinder lubricants for low-speed, two-stroke crosshead marine diesel engines. Its BN 25, 40, 50, 55, 70 and 100 grades provide different levels of alkaline reserve for cylinder lubrication. The formulation is designed to support piston-ring and liner cleanliness, neutralization of combustion acids, deposit control and protection against corrosive and mechanical wear.",
  "Deniz-Yaglari:yokomarin-wr-series":
    "YOKOHAMA YOKOMARIN WR Series comprises SAE 30 crankcase oils for medium-speed, four-stroke trunk-piston marine diesel engines. BN 30, BN 40 and BN 55 grades provide different levels of alkaline reserve for marine and stationary power applications. The formulation is designed to support engine cleanliness, neutralization of combustion acids, oil-film protection and control of oxidation and corrosive wear.",
  "Deniz-Yaglari:yokomarin-ws-series":
    "YOKOHAMA YOKOMARIN WS Series comprises single-grade crankcase oils for four-stroke trunk-piston marine diesel engines. SAE 30 and SAE 40 grades are available with BN 12, BN 15 and BN 20 levels. The formulations are designed to support engine cleanliness, oxidation stability, corrosion protection and neutralization of acidic combustion products in medium-speed engine service.",
};
